				<!-- Heading -->
									<h2>Why join a data network?</h2>
							<!-- Lead -->
					<div class="lead"><p>A trusted, unified data network serves as the connective tissue between financial institutions. Transition from manual, one-to-one communication toward a “one-to-many” collaborative model that maintains the highest level of data integrity and interoperability.</p>
</div>
