								</div>
																					<div class="content-container">
								<div class="content">
																			<h6>Asset managers</h6>
																												<div class="body-l"><p>Reduce fails, time spent chasing brokers or custodians, and settlement costs. Improve operational alpha and post-trade management operations. Ensure accuracy of daily NAV calculations and margin calls.</p>
</div>
																										</div>
															</div>
						</div>
											<div class="column third ">
															<div class="image-container full">
