								</div>
																					<div class="content-container">
								<div class="content">
																			<h6>Hedge funds</h6>
																												<div class="body-l"><p>Gain shared real-time visibility of enhanced exception queues. Reduce risk, capital, and operational overhead aggregated across PBs/global custodians.</p>
</div>
																										</div>
															</div>
						</div>
											<div class="column third ">
															<div class="image-container full">
